        "author": "Marco Almbauer",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "notes": "Inspected north elevation December2022. Twin slender green needle spires flank nave/choir junction, square stone belfries with Gothic crowns, higher broad western nave roof and lower eastern choir with ridge fleche. Tall pointed window bays, small nave dormers and low northern chapel ranges. Snow/soot not baked into colors."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Brno_Cathedral_St._Peter_and_Paul-03.jpg",
