        "author": "Radler59",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "notes": "Inspected clear north street view. Mixed warm rubble stone with lighter trims, steep gray-green metal nave roof, four small dormers, long pointed glazing, side chapel with paired small windows and hip cap, north tower clock and crown/needle spire."
      },
